I'm doing fine

60
00:05:23,763 --> 00:05:27,108
出会えた 奇跡に
Meeting you was a miracle...

61
00:05:27,363 --> 00:05:35,608
もう息が止まりそうだよ
It feels like my breath is stopping.

62
00:05:45,945 --> 00:05:51,145
何を見ているの
What are you looking at

63
00:05:51,145 --> 00:05:58,045
どこまでも澄んだ瞳で
with such endlessly clear eyes?

64
00:05:58,908 --> 00:06:03,808
二人きりなら 許される
If it's just the two of us, we'll be forgiven

65
00:06:04,808 --> 00:06:09,708
世界で
in this world,

66
00:06:09,708 --> 00:06:14,108
全てが今 始まるから
because everything is starting right now.

67
00:06:17,093 --> 00:06:20,933
君に出逢うために
Born just to meet you,

68
00:06:20,933 --> 00:06:26,363
生まれたこと 伝えたいよ
I want to tell you that's why I was born.

69
00:06:30,293 --> 00:06:34,763
そよ風も逃がさない
Not even letting the gentle breeze escape,

70
00:06:34,763 --> 00:06:38,863
視線も全部
and all of my gaze...

71
00:06:39,793 --> 00:06:47,913
ひりひりする声になるのさ ずっと
Turning into a burning, stinging voice, forever.

72
00:06:53,723 --> 00:07:00,363
濁りのない 寂しき気持ちは
Feelings of loneliness without any cloudiness,

73
00:07:00,708 --> 00:07:06,108
ヒリヒリするほど 高鳴ってる
throbbing so intensely it stings.

74
00:07:06,708 --> 00:07:11,108
二人きり 未来へと
Just the two of us, flying into the future,

75
00:07:11,108 --> 00:07:15,708
とべるんだ
we can fly away.

76
00:07:22,708 --> 00:07:28,108
どこへ行くの 小さな
Where are you heading? Tears well up in my small self,

77
00:07:28,108 --> 00:07:35,608
自分に涙あふれるけど 走り出せる
but I can start running.

78
00:07:35,908 --> 00:07:40,908
どこへ行くの 小さな
Where are you heading, little one?

79
00:07:40,908 --> 00:07:50,608
自分に涙あふれるけど 走り出せる
Tears overflow within me, yet I can run forth.

80
00:07:53,908 --> 00:07:59,608
もしも はぐれたら
If we ever get separated,

81
00:07:59,608 --> 00:08:04,808
体ごと 散ってみせる
I'll scatter my whole body apart.

82
00:08:06,708 --> 00:08:14,808
花びらだった 一番の姿に
Returning to the shape of petals at our finest.

83
00:08:14,908 --> 00:08:18,108
さあ 帰って
Now, return,

84
00:08:18,108 --> 00:08:23,808
君の愛 求めて サービスするよ
seeking your love, I'll give you my all.

85
00:08:24,108 --> 00:08:28,108
ずっと 君には
Forever to you,

86
00:08:28,108 --> 00:08:32,808
ラブを送るよ
I will send my love.

87
00:08:33,108 --> 00:08:37,608
満たされない 刺激的な気持ちが
Feelings of unfulfilled excitement

88
00:08:37,608 --> 00:08:42,108
時を超えて 呼び合う
call out to each other across time.

89
00:08:43,608 --> 00:08:49,108
二人きり 未来へと
Just the two of us, taking off into the future,

90
00:08:49,108 --> 00:08:55,608
飛び立つんだ
we will soar away.

91
